# ═══ 옛글자 조합형 자모 (U+1100 블록, 옛글자 코드포인트만): 첫소리/모음/받침 dots ═══
# NOTE: modern jamo of the U+1100 block are not defined, so fully
# composed 옛한글 syllables (e.g. ᄒᆞᆫ) are not supported yet — only the
# archaic letters themselves.
